<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/persepolis" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/persepolis.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/october-1">1 October</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Alexander defeats Darius III at Gaugamela</h3><p class="tih-event-desc"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/alexander-the-great">Alexander the Great</a> routed the far larger army of the Persian king <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/darius-iii">Darius III</a> near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-gaugamela">Gaugamela</a> in northern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mesopotamia">Mesopotamia</a>. The victory broke Achaemenid power and opened the road to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/babylon">Babylon</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/susa">Susa</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/persepolis">Persepolis</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/persepolis">Persepolis</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/darius-iii">Darius III</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-gaugamela" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-gaugamela.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-gaugamela">Battle of Gaugamela</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Gaugamela was fought in 331 BCE in northern Mesopotamia between Alexander the Great and the Achaemenid king Darius III.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-pandosia">Battle of Pandosia</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Pandosia was fought in 331 BCE near the town of Pandosia in Bruttium, southern Italy.</p></div></li></ol></section>
